# Ruwaq landing design (locked)

Do not regress these decisions without explicit user approval.

## Palette
- Backgrounds: `#ffffff`, `#fbfbfd`, `#fafafa`
- Text: `ruwaq-ink` `#1d1d1f`, soft `#6e6e73`, muted `#86868b`
- Accent: `ruwaq-gold` `#c9a063` only (logo-aligned; no brown replacement)
- Hero band: `ruwaq-navy` `#0f172a`

## Typography (Arabic)
- Font: **Almarai 700** for headings (never 800 extra-bold)
- Section titles: `clamp(1.875rem, 4.2vw, 2.375rem)`, `line-height: 1.52`
- Hero title: `line-height: 1.48`, weight 700
- Eyebrows: `text-sm`, gold, no uppercase in AR
- Hero subtitle highlight: `ruwaq-hero-lead-highlight` — gold, bold phrase only (e.g. حزمة بنود معتمدة تحميك)
- Hero inputs: `subtitleIntro` + 3 horizontal pills (`ruwaq-hero-input-pill`) + outcome line below

## Hero layout
- Split: copy **left**, circular `hero.jpg` **right** (`direction: ltr` on grid)
- Image crop: `object-position: 70% 24%` to show RUWAQ on screen
- CTAs: gold primary + white outline on navy
- Header CTA: `btn-ruwaq-header-gold`

## Hero tickets (4 cards)
- Section **after** hero, `margin-top` negative (~3rem) — top sliver overlaps navy, rest on white
- Centered: SVG illustration → title → body
- Content = proposal components: scope, timeline, payments, PDF (not generic platform benefits)
- Features & trust pillars: centered `ruwaq-illustration-card` with SVG icons (no emoji)

## Sections order
Hero → tickets → steps → problem → features → trustPartner (clause pack) → why table → sample → final CTA

## Motion
- `ruwaq-reveal` fade-up; respect `prefers-reduced-motion`
- Cards: soft shadow hover lift (`ruwaq-premium` / `ruwaq-float`)

## Copy
- No em dash (—) in UI strings
- Primary CTA always routes to `/proposals/new`
- Bilingual via `ar.ts` / `en.ts` + `types.ts`
